{"channelId":"UCmDxEoyh03CuFqeM7X_t7fw","row":["Southeast Veterinary Neurology",47800,"As leaders in veterinary neurology, neurosurgery, and advanced imaging, Southeast Veterinary Neurology (SEVN) exclusively treats diseases of the brain, spinal cord, nerves, and muscles including vertigo, seizures, strokes, brain tumors, and paralysis in dogs and cats. \n\nSEVN was built on a promise to be there when families need us and to treat each patient as if it were our own pet. We keep this promise every day by providing compassionate neurological care to patients, empathetic service to pet parents, and humble expertise to the veterinary communities in our Florida and Virginia locations.\n\nTo learn more about Southeast Veterinary Neurology please visit us at https://SEVNeurology.com.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmDxEoyh03CuFqeM7X_t7fw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmDxEoyh03CuFqeM7X_t7fw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:34.679Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmDxEoyh03CuFqeM7X_t7fw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:07:24.776Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/southeastveterinaryneurology","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":42711,"raw":"42711","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/southeastveterinaryneurology/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:14:04.358Z"},{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/southeast.veterinary.neurology","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":34482,"raw":"34,482","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/southeast.veterinary.neurology/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:14:02.235Z"},{"platform":"tiktok","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@southeastveterinaryneuro","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":47800,"raw":"47800","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/embed/@southeastveterinaryneuro?embedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-18T0